  "fluff": {
    "overview": "<p>Com Guard conventional infantry benefit from ComStar's access to preserved Star League technology, fielding weapons and equipment that match or exceed the standard issue of any Inner Sphere military, backed by the institutional discipline of the secular Order's professional military culture. Manning assault-class field autocannon, these gun crews bring devastating close-range firepower that can cripple armored vehicles and even threaten BattleMech limbs, though the weapon's bulk limits mobility and rate of repositioning.</p>"
